@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/chess-save-difficulty.puml
' purpose: Coach difficulty already persists — StarChess opponent is not this enum
' status: OUTDATED — shipped for Coach; product split
' covers: apps/ui/src/store/settingsStore.ts
' live spec: _spec/apps/ui/entities.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' Coach ""difficulty"" (intermediate / advanced / expert) lives in
' ""chess_coach_settings_state"" via ""createPersistedStore"". StarChess
' opponent script is naive|strategic on the URL + session blob, not a
' second elo picker. NewGamePanel resetting to naive is not this item.
title OUTDATED — Coach difficulty already restores;\ndo not add a parallel StarChess elo key

component "settingsStore.difficulty" as PICK <<app>>
database "chess_coach_settings_state" as KEY <<db>>
component "StarChess opponent\nnaive | strategic" as OPP <<app>>
component "**in-memory only**" as MEM <<error>>
component "**a second difficulty enum**" as FORK <<error>>

PICK ARROW_MAIN KEY
KEY ARROW_MAIN PICK : restore on enter
MEM ARROW_ERROR KEY : shipped anti-goal
OPP ARROW_ERROR FORK : different product

note bottom of KEY
  **Refresh already restores the Coach
  picker.** Export of Coach games is
  ""gameShare.ts"", not this plan.
end note

note right of OPP
  **Do not store Adjutant script in
  the Coach difficulty key.** Resume
  / rematch already copy ""?opponent="".
end note

legend bottom
  **Do not implement this file.**
  ==
  Group analytics on
  ""StarChessGameRecord.opponent"",
  not on Coach elo.
end legend
@enduml
